msgstr "補完、連携候補"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/ecosystem.md
#: cd8b53a4f3f741a6a7eeba04d5be3b56
msgid ""
"Interferometer simulation and design tools. GWexpy converts their "
"frequency-domain outputs into its own containers rather than "
"reimplementing the simulators"
msgstr "干渉計のシミュレーション・設計ツール。GWexpy はシミュレータを再実装するのではなく、その周波数領域の出力を自身のコンテナへ変換する"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/ecosystem.md:81
#: a3d04424702f4f86b9e36653b65299f7
msgid "What Makes GWexpy Different"
msgstr "GWexpy の特徴"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/ecosystem.md:83
#: 6c08a1510b844bbeb5bf4685b5af9bd2
msgid ""
"**GWpy-compatible by construction.** New containers stay readable as GWpy"
" objects wherever possible, so code can move between the two without a "
"rewrite."
msgstr ""
"**設計上 GWpy 互換**。新しいコンテナは可能な限り GWpy "
"オブジェクトとして読める状態を保つため、書き換えなしに両者の間でコードを移動できます。"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/ecosystem.md:85
#: 9ab0f4a9fd4a4bb8b994b0ad7b356ec7
msgid ""
"**Matrix-native analysis.** `TimeSeriesMatrix`, `FrequencySeriesMatrix`, "
"and `SpectrogramMatrix` treat multichannel data as a first-class shape "
"rather than as a loop over a dictionary."
msgstr ""
"**行列ネイティブな解析**。`TimeSeriesMatrix`・`FrequencySeriesMatrix`・`SpectrogramMatrix`"
" は、マルチチャンネルデータを辞書に対するループではなく第一級の形状として扱います。"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/ecosystem.md:88
#: a88461f770db469d955c52089f0fde94
msgid ""
"**Typed analysis results.** Coupling, response, and fitting workflows "
"return dedicated result objects instead of bare arrays or ad-hoc "
"dictionaries."
msgstr "**型付きの解析結果**。カップリング・応答・フィッティングのワークフローは、素の配列やその場しのぎの辞書ではなく専用の結果オブジェクトを返します。"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/ecosystem.md:90
#: 921f2ca5f3374e919381c054df57c02b
msgid ""
"**Broad I/O without a single canonical backend.** HDF5, NetCDF4, Zarr, "
"GWF, DTT XML, ndscope HDF5, and instrument-specific logger formats are "
"all supported paths; none of them is privileged as *the* storage format."
msgstr ""
"**単一の正準バックエンドを持たない広い I/O**。HDF5・NetCDF4・Zarr・GWF・DTT XML・ndscope "
"HDF5、および計測器固有のロガー形式はいずれも対応経路であり、どれか一つを*正準の*保存形式として特別扱いしません。"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/ecosystem.md:93
#: 801f517704ae4b5a8ddcec388618fde7
msgid ""
"**Generic source-to-target coupling.** Coupling and projection are "
"expressed in terms of a source and a target, not in terms of a specific "
"detector's naming conventions."
msgstr ""
"**汎用の source→target カップリング**。カップリングと射影は特定の検出器の命名規約ではなく、source と target "
"という言葉で表現されます。"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/ecosystem.md:95
#: 36b526ef74844e118fb7e0f6d32f85aa
msgid ""
"**Library-first and notebook-friendly.** The public surface is Python "
"objects and functions; the command-line interface is a thin convenience "
"layer, not the primary product."
msgstr ""
"**ライブラリ優先かつ Notebook 向き**。公開されるのは Python "
"のオブジェクトと関数であり、コマンドラインインターフェースは主たる成果物ではなく薄い補助層です。"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/ecosystem.md:98
#: d7da1aa80c2d414e9e4010e3085bc384
msgid "What GWexpy Deliberately Does Not Do"
msgstr "GWexpy が意図的に行わないこと"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/ecosystem.md:100
#: ebc8d738d6f94ea8a81de9c8ebb0f316
msgid ""
"Keeping these outside the core is what allows the container, I/O, and "
"interop layers to stay general. GWexpy does not aim to provide:"
msgstr ""
"これらを core の外に置くことで、コンテナ・I/O・interop の各層を汎用に保てます。GWexpy "
"は次のものを提供することを目指しません。"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/ecosystem.md:103
#: 30033fe32a094e3fb5fbab445078591d
msgid "detector- or site-specific operational pipelines"
msgstr "検出器やサイトに固有の運用パイプライン"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/ecosystem.md:104
#: cd55962c280c47ef94ef08d4af2d5c26
